OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely cloudy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle moving
OL,7,Fnorth through the morning. Remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy through the afternoon but
OL,9,Fbecoming largely dry. Breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with spells of rain
OL,12,Fdeveloping once again through the
OL,13,Fevening, becoming heavy over western
OL,14,Fhills. Rain will gradually move
OL,15,Fwestward overnight, becoming drier
OL,16,Falong eastern coasts.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain through much
OL,19,Fof Tuesday, this heavy over western
OL,20,Fhills. The best of any drier spells
OL,21,Falong eastern coasts. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
